# =============================================================================
# This repo publishes ONLY the public website (shop-website-public/) to
# GitHub Pages. Everything else in this folder is the PRIVATE self-hosted
# dashboard and its data — it must never be pushed here.
# These rules make `git add .` safe: it can only pick up website files.
# =============================================================================

# --- private dashboard code ---
/SignshopDashboard.py
/app.py
/static/
/templates/
/requirements.txt
/setup-autostart.ps1

# --- private repo clone + demo kit (their own repos / not for Pages) ---
/repo/
/demo/

# --- live data & secrets (NEVER publish) ---
/config.json
/dashboard.db
/tokens.json
/uploads/
/backups/

# --- python / editor / os junk ---
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
